TIP:  For the opening notes first form up (Am).  Pick the covered 3rd string <a>, then the bottom/1st string <e>, now place your pinky on the 2nd string/3rd fret and pick <d>, lift off your pinky and pick <c>, pick the still-covered 3rd string <a>, lift your ring finger off the 3rd string and pick the now-open 3rd string <g>, replace your ring finger and strum (Am).  Actually pretty easy.   


